# Independent review of graph/4.1.kg (bootstrap language). One review node per claim, each naming the digest it read.

n: 9.5.8
kind: hub
name: review-of-bootstrap-language
is: All 38 claims of 4.1.kg (12 observations from files and runs, 15 relayed web observations, 11 findings) were read against their sources: 28 confirmed, 10 amended (4.1.1.4, 4.1.1.8, 4.1.2.6, 4.1.4.4, 4.1.5.1, 4.1.5.2, 4.1.8.1, 4.1.9.1, 4.1.9.2, 4.1.9.3), none disputed, none left unreviewed.
limit: The study's experiment programs and logs were opened in its scratchpad (study/exp) and the three old-body files at the cited lines. All 40 cited pages were fetched again through the same kind of summarising tool, so the web re-reads are relayed a second time, not observed. The experiments were not rerun, except a rebuild of the no_std Rust program and one cross-link attempt.
